  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/04/P1550206.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 360px;\" /></p>\n<p>(51 fotos) Kids&amp;Us Onda, en la plaza Corts Valencianes, 8,&nbsp;ha acodigo este s&aacute;bado unos talleres en ingl&eacute;s&nbsp;para desarrollar&nbsp;experimentos cient&iacute;ficos.&nbsp;Se han celebrado&nbsp;dos sesiones, a las 10.30 y a las 12.00 horas. Esta es una iniciativa muy atractiva&nbsp;en la que ni&ntilde;os y ni&ntilde;as han realizo actividades 100% en ingl&eacute;s y han disfrutado con el idioma.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/madscientistkidsampus/p1550160.jpg\" alt=\"p1550160\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/madscientistkidsampus/p1550162.jpg\" alt=\"p1550162\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/madscientistkidsampus/p1550163.jpg\" alt=\"p1550163\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/madscientistkidsampus/p1550164.jpg\" alt=\"p1550164\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/madscientistkidsampus/p1550165.jpg\" alt=\"p1550165\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/madscientistkidsampus/p1550166.jpg\" alt=\"p1550166\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/madscientistkidsampus/p1550167.jpg\" alt=\"p1550167\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/madscientistkidsampus/p1550168.jpg\" alt=\"p1550168\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/madsc